    "# Hour 2: Clean, Explore, Outliers and Relations"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## CONCEPT: Step 3: Clean\n",
    "\n",
    "For every problem, choose a fix and say **why**:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Problem | Fix | Why |\n",
    "|---------|-----|-----|\n",
    "| `deck` is missing for 688 of 891 rows | **drop** the column | too much is missing. We can't guess it |\n",
    "| `alive`, `class`, `embark_town`, `who`, `adult_male` | **drop** them | they repeat other columns |\n",
    "| `age` is missing for 177 rows | **fill** with the median | 177 rows is too many to throw away. The median is not changed by very old or very young people |\n",
    "| `embarked` is missing for 2 rows | **fill** with the most common value | only 2 rows. `mode()` gives the most common value |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### EXAMPLE: Clean the data"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
